sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Accountant
  participant UI
  participant Workflow
  participant Target
  participant Validator
  Accountant->>UI: Prepare agreed productive invoice
  UI->>Workflow: Check versioned FPU and prerequisites
  Workflow->>UI: Preview invoice and required approval
  Accountant->>Workflow: Explicitly approve current invoice
  Workflow->>Target: Post once using scoped idempotency
  Target->>Validator: Receipt and resulting synthetic accounting state
  Validator->>Workflow: Verify deterministic effect and all controls
  Workflow->>Accountant: Verified FPU evidence or safe blocker
